{
  "_comment": [
    "Maps every movement id in strength_catalog.json and movement_catalog.json to the",
    "artwork used to build its looping demo clip, plus any clip that only",
    "mobility_catalog.json reaches through its mediaExerciseID field.",
    "",
    "Source tiers, in preference order:",
    "  1. gifdb  - 3D anatomical render, working muscles highlighted red, white background,",
    "              already animated. This is the house style. Covers gym strength and most",
    "              static stretches; thin on running drills and foam rolling.",
    "  2. fitnessprogramer - the same render family, far wider selection. Carries the",
    "              mobility, plyometric and foam-rolling movements the GitHub mirrors lack.",
    "              Its clips have a site logo, painted out via the source's 'watermark' rect.",
    "  3. photo  - photographic demo of a real person, start + end frame. Used only where",
    "              neither render tier has an honest match. Looped by crossfading the two.",
    "  4. repdb  - flat vector illustration, single frame. Currently unused; kept so the",
    "              tier does not have to be rediscovered if a gap ever needs it again.",
    "  5. none   - no honest match in any set. The app falls back to the movement's",
    "              SF Symbol. Never map a movement to artwork of a DIFFERENT movement just",
    "              to fill the slot.",
    "",
    "'approximate' marks a clip whose artwork shows a close variant rather than the exact",
    "movement. The clip still teaches the pattern; the cue text governs the details."
  ],
  "sources": {
    "gifdb": {
      "repo": "https://github.com/JahelCuadrado/ExerciseGymGifsDB",
      "rawBase": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JahelCuadrado/ExerciseGymGifsDB/main",
      "style": "anatomical-render",
      "kind": "animated-gif"
    },
    "photo": {
      "repo": "https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db",
      "rawBase": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises",
      "style": "photo",
      "kind": "image-pair"
    },
    "repdb": {
      "repo": "https://github.com/RepDB/exercise-dataset",
      "rawBase": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RepDB/exercise-dataset/main/images/flat",
      "style": "illustration",
      "kind": "image-single"
    },
    "fitnessprogramer": {
      "repo": "https://fitnessprogramer.com",
      "rawBase": "https://fitnessprogramer.com/wp-content/uploads",
      "style": "anatomical-render",
      "kind": "animated-gif",
      "watermark": [0, 0, 118, 50],
      "watermarkSourceSize": [360, 360]
    }
  },
